# EDGE CASE TESTS

## Character Name Variations

INT. TEST ROOM - DAY

Basic character test.

JOHN
Hello world.

JOHN (CONT'D)
Continued dialogue.

JOHN (O.S.)
Off-screen dialogue.

JOHN (V.O.)
Voice over dialogue.

JOHN (FILTERED)
Filtered dialogue.

@COMPUTER
Computer generated voice.

@ROBOT (V.O.)
Robot voice over.

~MARY sings
La la la, this is a song.

MARY
(singing)
More singing here.

## Dual Dialogue Tests

                    ALICE ^
          I'm speaking on the left side.

                    BOB ^
          I'm speaking on the right side.

They continue speaking simultaneously.

                    ALICE ^
          This continues the dual dialogue.

                    BOB ^
          Yes, we're both talking at once.

## Forced Elements

!FORCED ACTION LINE: This should be treated as action.

!Another forced action.

Regular action line.

.FORCED SCENE HEADING

Action after forced scene.

