## Complex Parentheticals

                    SPEAKER
                    (whispering)
          Secret message.

                    SPEAKER
                    (shouting over noise)
          Can you hear me?

                    SPEAKER
                    (to another character)
          This is directed dialogue.

                    SPEAKER
                    (beat)
          After a pause.

                    SPEAKER
                    (continuing)
          This continues the thought.

