## Transition vs Scene Disambiguation

FADE TO:

Not a scene heading.

FADE TO BLACK.

Still not a scene heading.

SOME LOCATION

This might be confused with a character.

                    SOME LOCATION
          But this is clearly dialogue.

## Long Dialogue Blocks

                    VERBOSE CHARACTER
          This is a very long dialogue block
          that spans multiple lines and contains
          a lot of text to test how the parser
          handles extended speech patterns.

                    VERBOSE CHARACTER (CONT'D)
          And this continues the long dialogue
          with even more text that goes on and
          on and on to really test the limits
          of the parser's ability to handle
          extended dialogue sequences.

## Rapid Transitions

